  "body": "*Currently under construction with an estimated completion date of May 2027*\r\n\r\nThere are zero reasons to wait with our latest offer! **For a limited time**, buyers can secure a brand-new Wolfbrook home with **Zero Deposit*** needed upfront and enjoy **$10K Cashback***.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, your next home, or investing in property, there's zero reasons to wait. **Offer ends 31 October**. *T&Cs apply.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Presenting 4 Whitehaven Road, Glendowie**. A striking collection of six architecturally designed homes, offering refined coastal living with exceptional everyday convenience. This exclusive release features **two-bedroom, two-bathroom residences**, each complete with an **off-street car park**, all just moments from beautiful beaches and lush green spaces. \r\n\r\n**Home 1 enjoys prominent street appeal** with direct access from the road, creating a welcoming and distinctive presence. \r\n\r\nInside, thoughtfully designed open-plan living areas flow seamlessly into contemporary kitchens and private outdoor spaces, delivering effortless indoor-outdoor living. Generous layouts, durable finishes, and low-maintenance landscaping ensure these homes combine style with long-term practicality. \r\n\r\nIdeal for home buyers, growing families, and investors alike, 4 Whitehaven Road presents a rare opportunity to secure a beautifully crafted, brand-new home in a desirable neighbourhood. \r\n\r\n**The Location**\r\n> Just moments from **St Heliers Beach** and **Karaka Bay**, plus boutique shops, cafés, and eateries\r\n> Walking distance to the green spaces of **Churchill Park, Glendowie Park,** and **Roberta Reserve**, which borders Glendowie Bay\r\n> Zoned for the highly regarded **Glendowie School, Churchill Park School,** and **Glendowie College**, with **Sacred Heart College** a short drive away\r\n> Quick drive to **Glen Innes** for supermarkets, retail and everyday amenities\r\n> Close to **Eastridge and Meadowbank Shopping Centres, Mission Bay,** and **Auckland CBD**\r\n\r\n**Why Wolfbrook?** \r\nAs one of New Zealand's premier property developers, Wolfbrook Residential excels in delivering top-tier, tailor-made homes for homeowners and investors alike. Our track record speaks of our commitment to quality and craftsmanship. We understand that each property demands a unique approach. Wolfbrook goes beyond mere construction; we partner with you to achieve your financial goals and unlock the path to financial freedom.\r\n\r\n**Considering adding to your property portfolio?** \r\nAs well as offering great tenant appeal, each home delivers an impressive gross rental yield – making it one of the smartest, turnkey buys available right now. Plus, Wolfbrook offers a 2 Year Rental Guarantee* when you choose to have your property professionally managed by us — giving you even greater peace of mind from day one.\r\n\r\n**Want a closer look at a completed Wolfbrook home?** Visit our Auckland showhome at 1/15 Line Road, Glen Innes, open every Saturday & Sunday from 11am–1pm.\r\n\r\nIt’s a great chance to explore the quality craftsmanship and thoughtful design that defines a Wolfbrook home. Take a walk through the finished space, meet our friendly team, and imagine what your future home could look like. We’d love to welcome you!\r\n\r\n*T&C’s apply please visit https://wolfbrook.co.nz/resources/terms-conditions-zero-deposit-10k-cashback-offer",
